# 📍 Check-IN Hub (Geo Clock-In)

A location-based attendance tracking system that allows users to securely **clock in and out** using geolocation and authentication.

---

## 🚀 Live Demo

* 🌐 Frontend: https://your-frontend.onrender.com
* 🔗 Backend API: https://your-backend.onrender.com

---

## 📌 Overview

Check-IN Hub is a full-stack web application designed to help organizations track user attendance based on **real-time location**.

Users can:

* ✅ Sign in securely
* 📍 Clock in using their current location
* 📊 View attendance records

Admins can:

* 👀 View all user clock-ins
* 📈 Monitor attendance data

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend

* React (Vite)
* TypeScript / JavaScript
* CSS

### Backend

* Node.js
* Express.js

### Authentication & Database

* Supabase (Auth + Database)

### Deployment

* Render (Frontend + Backend)

---

## 🔐 Authentication

Authentication is handled via **Supabase Auth**:

* Email & password login
* Session-based authentication
* Protected clock-in functionality

---

## 📍 Features

* 🌍 Geolocation-based clock-in
* 🔐 User authentication (Supabase)
✅ Role-based access (Admin vs User)
* ⏱️ Timestamped attendance records
📱 Mobile responsiveness improvements
* 📡 REST API integration
* 📊 Admin dashboard (view all clock-ins)
* ⚡ Auto-deploy via GitHub + Render

